            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> @JonatasAmaral, have you tried suggested solutions?\r\n\r\nSorry, i've missed your answer (that one was fast), Github just notified me about this second.\r\n\r\nSo i've tested LazyVim (tanks to `$NVIM_APPNAME`), and that works really well, just as i was expecting.\r\nSo made some minor adaptations to work for mine (still using Packer on main config), and now it's going great.\r\n\r\nI didn't even tried out setting `vim.o.mousescroll`, as i thing would mess with the current experience anyways, and as that LazyVim's config worked just fine, didn't need to.\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks for your help @echasnovski !",
